<title>CANADA: Toronto stock market sets another record at close.</title>
<headline>Toronto stock market sets another record at close.</headline>
<text>
<p>CHANGE				     CHANGE</p>
<p>TSE	5975.56    +23.19    HI 5976.82	  LOW    5950.06</p>
<p>DJI	6528.41    -19.38    GOLD (LONDON)   US$374.50  -0.20</p>
<p>FTSE100  4068.40    +13.80    GOLD (NY-COMEX) US$373.50  -1.90</p>
<p>NIKKEI  21418.25   +124.68    LME CASH NICKEL US$6925   +115.0</p>
<p>CANDLR    1.3430		  LME CASH ALUM   US$1499.0  -14.5</p>
<p>CAN 30-YR 115.65     +0.47    BRENT CRUDE OIL US$22.75   +0.12</p>
<p>---------------------MARKET COMMENT---------------------------</p>
<p>* Toronto Stock Exchange closed stronger after interest in heavily-weighted Barrick Gold soared on news of negotiations with Bre-X Minerals. * But decliners outpaced advancers.</p>
